<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-059-B habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.309335" lon="-120.903011"><name>SC26-059-B</name><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 5.9 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 61/100; not catch probability. Center 124 ft; nearby 119–135 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Parallel bands visible in survey rendering; confirm small-scale relief by sonar. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-042</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.31072495707528" lon="-120.90259062705546"/><trkpt lat="35.31045462948877" lon="-120.90259760823767"/><trkpt lat="35.31038549630578" lon="-120.90380916714895"/><trkpt lat="35.310126604750295" lon="-120.90447572354522"/><trkpt lat="35.310230051862284" lon="-120.90524290917583"/><trkpt lat="35.30977950507484" lon="-120.90525452950851"/><trkpt lat="35.30998067310424" lon="-120.90645910930557"/><trkpt lat="35.30962023538176" lon="-120.90646840011176"/><trkpt lat="35.309625946657555" lon="-120.90679818829437"/><trkpt lat="35.30863474259052" lon="-120.90682373314347"/><trkpt lat="35.308090278548455" lon="-120.90661781151233"/><trkpt lat="35.3069918281888" lon="-120.90565634706697"/><trkpt lat="35.30697468342967" lon="-120.90466701559156"/><trkpt lat="35.30732559240785" lon="-120.90410808703254"/><trkpt lat="35.30759592039611" lon="-120.9041011116822"/><trkpt lat="35.30758257618937" lon="-120.90333162661993"/><trkp